WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.975
Module 2 is the exception:
cross-tenant synchronization.

2
00:00:03.975 --> 00:00:07.988
It covers the conditions that must
all hold before sync is allowed,

3
00:00:07.988 --> 00:00:11.564
the terms the agency states and
then tests in its own tenant,

4
00:00:11.564 --> 00:00:15.650
and how to end a sync relationship
without leaving accounts behind.

5
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:20.350
It closes with who does the work, on
the partner's side and the agency's.
